  m_Name: Carta_ParceriaPublicoPrivadaDeInfraestrutura
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Parceria P\xFAblico-Privada de Infraestrutura"
  _titleEn: Public-Private Infrastructure Partnership
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Na PPP, uma empresa privada constr\xF3i e opera uma obra p\xFAblica
    por d\xE9cadas e \xE9 paga pelo governo, pelos usu\xE1rios ou pelos dois."
  _summaryEn: In a public-private partnership, a private company builds and runs
    a public work for decades and is paid by the government, users or both.
  _realWorld: "A Linha 4 Amarela do Metr\xF4 de S\xE3o Paulo foi a primeira PPP do
    pa\xEDs, contratada com base na Lei 11.079 de 2004."
  _realWorldEn: "S\xE3o Paulo Metro's Line 4 Yellow was Brazil's first public-private
    partnership, contracted under Law 11,079 of 2004."
  _tradeOffs: "Contratos longos e complexos podem favorecer a empresa, e o governo
    continua respons\xE1vel se o servi\xE7o falhar."
  _tradeOffsEn: Long, complex contracts can favor the company, and the government
    remains responsible if the service fails.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Linha 4 do Metr\xF4 de S\xE3o Paulo (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linha_4_do_Metr%C3%B4_de_S%C3%A3o_Paulo
  - Label: Lei 11.079/2004 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2004-2006/2004/lei/l11079.htm
